  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The formula to calculate the velocity of the ball after&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>&nbsp;is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>The formula to calculate the velocity of the ball after&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>&nbsp;is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Divide equation (1) by equation (2) to obtain the required ratio.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Substitute the values of the known parameters into equation (3) to calculate the required ratio.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mfrac><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mn>150</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>150</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>120</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>Comparing the above equation with the given expression, it can be written that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>.</p>",
